:: Public Library
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "museum">><<effects>>
You are inside the public library. Huge shelves line the walls with books on all manner of subjects. 
<br><br>
There are the obvious subjects such as English, history, math, and science, but there are also books on local legends and stories. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Approach the common subjects shelf|Public Library Common]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Approach an older and dustier shelf containing the less popular books|Public Library Mod]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the library|Oxford Street]]>><</link>>

