:: Public Library Mod
You approach the much older section of the library. Old faded journals and notebooks from decades ago sit unread. If you were looking for something lost or forgotten, this would be the place.
<br><br>
<<schoolicon "library">><<link [[Forest Explorer's Journal (0:20)|Forest Explorer's Journal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>
